1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,350
Old posts link to pages that are gone.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:05,617
It runs on your own server. No account, no card, no link limit.

3
00:00:05,617 --> 00:00:07,817
Scan now checks the links and images in posts, pages and menus.

4
00:00:07,817 --> 00:00:09,767
One 404 is not enough.

5
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:13,067
It is checked again an hour later.

6
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:14,217
A site that blocks checkers stays Inconclusive, never Broken.

7
00:00:14,217 --> 00:00:16,167
A site that blocks checkers stays Inconclusive, never Broken.

8
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:18,117
It failed again, so it is Broken.

9
00:00:18,117 --> 00:00:21,717
Edit address changes one link.

10
00:00:21,717 --> 00:00:24,600
The new address is checked at once.

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,200
Tick the rows you want to fix.

12
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,150
Bulk actions change only the rows you ticked.

13
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:33,050
Only the two ticked rows changed.

14
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:36,050
Each fix in a post is a revision.

15
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,767
You can restore the version before the fix.

16
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:40,867
Pro adds scheduled scans.

17
00:00:40,867 --> 00:00:43,667
You choose the hour.

18
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:46,567
It emails the addresses you set.

19
00:00:46,567 --> 00:00:48,567
It runs by itself.

20
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:51,567
The email lists what broke, and where.
